# The CDK image assets use the REPO ROOT as build context (pnpm workspace
# symlinks cannot be followed from a per-app context). Without this file the
# staging copy recurses: cdk.out contains the asset, the asset contains cdk.out.
infra/cdk.out
**/cdk.out

node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.github
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/demo-dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.DS_Store
*.md
!README.md
